WEBVTT

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.460
Hey, are you okay?

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.450
Damn! They're already here!

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.990
Priss? Why are you here?

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:25.260
Who the hell is that? Is it that girl?

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.750
The AD Police are watching!
Don't talk to each other!

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.870
This is a mad boomer!

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:58.160
That Knight Saber is slower than the others.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.750
Get out of here while I attack it!

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:02.120
Take this!

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:09.900
Wait!

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.110
Are you all right? Why didn't you evacuate?

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:13.240
Huh?

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.210
Have I met you before?

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:19.680
Thank you, that was very helpful.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.700
You could have said that, couldn't you?

00:01:27.490 --> 00:01:29.220
What's with that woman?

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:37.820
Nene!

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:54.450
I... I can...

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:55.970
I can do it!

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.750
I was right about this girl.

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:05.560
Linna, hurry up and smash the core!

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:07.860
Until you smash the core,
the boomer won't stop!

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:10.330
Core? Roger!

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.760
No! Linna's meter is expended!

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.680
lmpossible! My power...

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:29.050
My suit... my suit's getting heavier.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:29.980
Linna!

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:32.510
Linna! Linna! Answer me!

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.360
Open up! Hurry!

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:39.990
No way. I can't move at all.

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:43.330
Am I dying now? This can't be!

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:50.700
Linna!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.620
What will happen to me if the
meter runs out completely?

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.320
An extra battery will release
you from the hard suit.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:09.690
But if you get out of the suit, you'll
be smashed and die, Linna!

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:18.690
I can't hold on.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.270
Something's wrong with the
Knight Sabers today.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:25.210
The goddess seems to be
smiling on us this time.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:28.440
Yep! We're going to get a boomer and
the Knight Sabers at the same time!

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:29.470
All right!

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.510
Stop!

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:37.550
I... I'm not a boomer!

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:38.180
Linna!

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:39.080
Linna!
Linna!

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:54.030
Oops!

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.950
Knight Sabers!

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:40.440
Stay where you are!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.150
Damn you.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:46.690
Target found! Two survivors confirmed!

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:48.920
You idiot, it's already over!

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.490
Wait! Please don't destroy my restaurant!

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:56.500
Our first priority is to take control of the boomer.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.530
Don't get in the way of official business!

00:04:58.530 --> 00:04:59.860
Oh no...

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:15.650
Data pattern...

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:16.910
Data pattern...

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:24.880
Linna...

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.700
Thanks. I think I'm all right now.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:41.170
I was surprised, because the suit
became heavy so suddenly.

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:44.140
Linna, you did a good job.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:46.610
Yeah! I think better of you now, Linna.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.750
No, please don't lie.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:50.940
Don't be ridiculous!

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:59.590
What the hell were you thinking, letting
her go into an actual battle?!

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:01.230
Please don't get so mad.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:03.420
The results were good, so it was okay, right?

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:05.820
Priss...

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:09.870
Thank you for rescuing me.

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:25.420
Priss!

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:28.510
I don't want to be on a team with an amateur.

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:35.240
Good afternoon.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:39.620
Do you want half?

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.490
Thanks for the food.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.640
This is really good.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:26.070
Too much mustard.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.150
Why are you here?

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:41.780
I'm sorry about last night.

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:46.190
I was so happy, because I got to wear
a hard suit for the first time.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:49.360
Even though I didn't know how to fight, I...

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:56.670
Say, why did you join the Knight Sabers?

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:58.100
For world peace?

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.310
Well?

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.210
Don't misunderstand me.

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:08.010
I don't know about Sylia,

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:12.990
but we don't intend to be champions
of justice or volunteers.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:17.250
Then why? Why do you risk your life? I...

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:23.630
Of course, I didn't think it would be easy,

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:26.500
but I didn't expect it to be so hard.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.900
Laying your life on the line, pushing
the hard suit to its limit...

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:34.530
Maybe that's why.

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.200
And for the money.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.450
Did I disappoint you?

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:49.360
But that's the way it is for me and Nene.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:53.990
Frankly speaking, if you're just
another fighter without purpose,

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:55.660
don't risk your life.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.060
I have purpose!

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:01.430
I'm going to be stronger than you, Priss!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.200
What is it, Meisio?

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:41.360
How long are you going to continue this?

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:44.610
Lady Sylia?

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:51.510
I don't like you worrying so much.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.890
I'm just getting into mischief with the girls.

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.560
I understand how you feel, but...

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.500
You don't understand at all!

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.700
I'm not doing this Knight Sabers
thing to avenge my father,

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:10.570
nor do I have any other dark motive.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:14.140
It's true.

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:16.540
Are you sure?

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:17.740
Jill or that other...

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.140
That was an accident!

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:28.310
I know I provide maximum security
for the current girls.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:35.720
I'm not a little girl, Meisio.

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:43.060
I've grown into a mature woman.

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:52.700
Meisio...

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:58.080
If you want to leave here, I won't mind.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:02.680
I like you, Lady Sylia. That's why I'm here.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.520
If you'll excuse me?

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:26.110
Yoohoo! It's me, Nene!

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:31.350
I just ducked into the Genom Server
a little while ago for a small peek,

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.450
and I found something important.

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:37.390
Well, there's a department which
keeps records of the serial numbers

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:39.230
of boomers that have gone berserk.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:43.000
The waitress that became violent at
the café the other day is listed.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:45.730
But it's so strange!

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:49.390
They also list the serial numbers of some
boomers that haven't gone mad yet.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:54.030
Well, see you later. I'll contact you
when I find something. Bye bye!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:06.420
Does that mean it's possible for them to
choose which boomers will go berserk?

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:09.520
No! It can't be.

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.080
That's not possible!

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:17.130
No matter what upgrades they have, the
core of the boomer can't be touched!

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:20.430
Papa wouldn't have created such an
easily understandable algorithm!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:25.230
But then, why?

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:27.970
Why?!

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:54.070
You're really not the kind of guy
to be buried in thought.

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:55.800
Leave me alone.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.670
It's a woman, right?

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:03.510
Why is it you become naive as a high
schoolboy every time you fall in love?

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:05.750
When the hell did I do that?

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:10.920
Sandra at the Lone Star, Shiori at the
Lonely Veil, Gladys at the Cat's Eye.

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:14.050
Are you an idiot or something? Those
are all just women I met in bars.

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:15.820
Yes, but you were pretty serious, weren't you?

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:18.520
I'm a shy person.

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:20.290
What the hell are you talking about?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:23.520
No one but you would give presents
to a woman just to get to know her.

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:30.130
I'm not interested in women
like that anymore.

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:35.210
Stay away from ordinary,
unprofessional women.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.300
Shut up, you jerk!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:49.450
I'm sure I've seen her before.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:55.420
That girl looked so strong-willed.

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:04.430
Damn!

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:19.850
Okay!

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:40.310
Overflowing lives on the outstretched Earth

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:50.150
Among the floating clouds, light is whispering

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:55.020
Even after a thousand years

00:15:55.020 --> 00:16:03.490
The source, though it seems like
it's made of glass, works

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:10.000
Feeling the stage of the sky,
where the wind is blowing

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:14.910
Feeling the desires of the sand,
feeling them unclearly

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:19.780
Who am I? Who are you?

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:20.980
Did you say you're going? To meet
someone? Where are you going?

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:22.920
Finally, I found you.
Did you say you're going? To meet
someone? Where are you going?

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:25.150
Did you say you're going? To meet
someone? Where are you going?

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:18.740
There are two years of blank space.

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:21.800
It's impossible to catch up,
no matter how I try.

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:13.930
All done!

00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:16.630
That's about all I can do for you.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:21.130
For more than that, you have to go
to the Genom Service Center.

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:25.170
Thank you very much. My working
ability is now better than before.

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:28.670
Sorry. We don't have much
money for maintenance.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:32.550
No. I've been treated very well here.

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:34.810
Well, I've got to get to bed.

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:36.010
Good night.

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.930
This place is off limits.

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:53.230
It's too dangerous. You should leave...

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:16.760
Today's audience didn't get
loud enough, did they?

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:19.720
Because your bass drum was out of sync!

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:21.790
You...

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:23.160
Hey, wait.

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:32.200
See you.

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:34.670
Hey, Priss, something happened
to you, didn't it?

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:41.750
Well, I felt you couldn't concentrate
on the show tonight.

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:50.450
Oh sorry, it must be my imagination.

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:01.200
"Thank you for helping me the other day."

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:04.170
I thought you might say that.

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:13.470
Is that the proper attitude to have
toward someone who saved your life?

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:18.550
Priss here.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:21.290
A mad boomer has appeared
in the industrial area.

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:23.790
Hey, say something!

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:25.150
Don't ignore me!

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:33.220
I hate those idiots in the AD Police.

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.450
Yeah? Leon here.

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:49.680
I heard a mad boomer has appeared.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.780
I'm sorry since you're off today.

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:55.110
What bad luck!

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.410
Next Episode

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:03.310
A huge mad boomer is going
berserk in the factory.

00:21:03.310 --> 00:21:08.320
By absorbing the machinery and power,
it's getting bigger and bigger.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:12.920
I can't believe it, but neither the AD
Police nor Priss are a match for it!

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:15.690
In this situation, there's no other
choice except to let Nene handle it.

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:19.230
Nene, hurry up! Both Priss
and Linna are in danger!

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:21.700
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
